      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the picture in **Subject**.\n3. Press **Run**. The draft is saved under `drafts/approved`, or `drafts/rejected` when Jev finds it distorted."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
